    "runtime_evidence": "The Hugging Face model card documents `vllm serve Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct-FP8`. A retained B200 probe showed vLLM 0.21.0 CUDA 13 fails before model load with cudaGetDeviceCount error 803 on the current B200 driver stack. A vLLM 0.10.2 CUDA 12.8 override starts on the same cluster and lists `qwen3_coder` as the valid Qwen3-Coder tool parser. A follow-up retained probe showed vLLM 0.10.2 needs an explicit --model argument to avoid its default Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B engine model and needs max-num-seqs >= 9 for Blackwell warmup.",
